ath11k/QCA6390/hw2.0/amss.bin     ath11k/QCA6390/hw2.0/amss.bin     8ab2a06422e3989012df423bb6a156fde2c3feb4cd5db4c5d3588f674dc872ff
ath11k/QCA6390/hw2.0/board-2.bin  ath11k/QCA6390/hw2.0/board-2.bin  4aa9f0fe15e9e2b6f9bb13b7187ed8ce035d9d46fb65fac5d5eba2c4e7edc091
ath11k/QCA6390/hw2.0/m3.bin       ath11k/QCA6390/hw2.0/m3.bin       1921d25edb52f90a7a0acc7275861e14399f904d579aae9f7ab1c4d28533fad6

